== Trivia ==
*'''Molbert''' is a reference to [https://nookipedia.com/wiki/Mr._Resetti Mr. Resetti] from the ''Animal Crossing'' games.
* The three traps '''Molbert''' requires to be placed down are located at {{Coords|-465.5|119|-53.5}}, {{Coords|-448.5|120|64.5}}, {{Coords|-439.5|122|-91.5}}.

